DESCRIPTION:Do good. Connect with Kelleys. Grab a bite.  Join fellow Atla
 nta Kelleys for a morning of giving back and getting together! We're team
 ing up to beautify a section of the iconic Atlanta Beltline's Westside Tr
 ail—followed by an optional\, casual\, post-service hang.  Whether you'
 re looking to expand your local network\, give back to Atlanta\, or just 
 spend a great morning outdoors with fellow Hoosiers\, we'd love to have y
 ou.Where and when:Clean-up\, 10 a.m. to noon: Atlanta Beltline Westside T
 rail. We'll meet at the Great Lawn Pavilion at Lee + White (1010 White St
 reet SW).  Optional social hour\, after we finish on the trail: We'll hea
 d to Monday Night Brewing's Garage (933 Lee Street SW) to relax\, catch u
 p\, and grab a bite or drink on your own tab.  Bring the crew: Family and
  friends are invited to join. Just be sure to register them as guests so 
 we have a spot (and enough supplies) for everyone.Zero prep needed: All c
 lean-up tools and equipment are provided. Just throw on some IU gear and 
 bring your Kelley spirit!&#160\;  Please register by Tuesday\, September 
 29. Questions? Contact the Kelley Alumni Engagement Team at busalum@iu.ed
 u (mailto:busalum@iu.edu) or 812-855-9000.
