 14">  No boring PowerPoint presentations. <span class="citation-151">No p
 assive lectures</span>.</p><p id="p-rc_668c47d0e5884af8-102" data-path-to
 -node="15"><span class="citation-150">As part of the</span><span class="c
 itation-150">Global Competencies Skills Development Series</span><span cl
 ass="citation-150">\, this 2-hour interactive simulation drops you direct
 ly into a live humanitarian crisis scenario where</span><span class="cita
 tion-150">you</span><span class="citation-150">call the shots</span>. <sp
 an class="citation-149">You'll work in interdisciplinary teams to navigat
 e high-stakes international negotiations where conflicting political inte
 rests\, limited resources\, and rapid deadlines are on the line</span>.</
 p><h4 data-path-to-node="17">  What You'll Get Out of It (Why You Need to
