SUMMARY:The Business Collective: Build Your Network
DESCRIPTION:THE BUSINESS COLLECTIVE  Build Your Network. Explore Your Opt
 ions. Prepare for What's Next.  Designed specifically for pre-business st
 udents\, the Business Collective connects students with upperclassmen\, I
 U alumni\, employers\, and career coaches who can help them navigate the 
 pre-business experience and explore what's possible beyond it.  Each virt
 ual session offers a different perspective\, giving students access to pe
 ople who can share candid advice\, expand their understanding of career p
 ossibilities\, and help them prepare for future opportunities.October 20t
 h: Build Your Network  The Real Pre-Business Playbook. Real talk from stu
 dents who've been there.  Connect with upperclassmen who have successfull
 y navigated the pre-business experience and get candid answers to the que
 stions first-year students actually want to ask.  Students will:Hear what
  upperclassmen wish they had known during their first year.  Get honest p
 erspectives on academics\, involvement\, experience\, and finding communi
 ty.  Learn strategies for making the most of the pre-business experience.
   Build connections with students who have already navigated the journey.
   Attend all three sessions to earn a Business Collective certificate.
