X-LIVEWHALE-SUMMARY:<p>\n  Professor James Lin will be visiting IU to tal
 k about his new book&#160\;<em>In the Global Vanguard: Agrarian Developme
 nt and the Making of Modern Taiwan</em>.&#160\;\n</p>
END:VEVENT
