SUMMARY:The Business Collective: Explore Your Options
DESCRIPTION:THE BUSINESS COLLECTIVE  Build Your Network. Explore Your Opt
 ions. Prepare for What's Next.  Designed specifically for pre-business st
 udents\, the Business Collective connects students with upperclassmen\, I
 U alumni\, employers\, and career coaches who can help them navigate the 
 pre-business experience and explore what's possible beyond it.  Each virt
 ual session offers a different perspective\, giving students access to pe
 ople who can share candid advice\, expand their understanding of career p
 ossibilities\, and help them prepare for future opportunities.NOVEMBER 10
 : EXPLORE YOUR OPTIONS  Careers Aren't Straight Lines. See where business
  can take you.  Meet IU alumni working across different areas of business
  and hear the real stories behind how they got from IU to where they are 
 today—including the decisions\, experiences\, connections\, and unexpec
 ted turns that shaped their careers.Students will:Discover business caree
 r paths they may not have considered.  Hear how alumni translated their I
 U experiences into careers.  Learn why career paths rarely follow a perfe
 ctly straight line.  Discover how networking can be used to explore caree
 rs and gather information—not simply ask for jobs.Attend all three sess
 ions to earn a Business Collective certificate.
